<details id="troubleshoot">
  <summary>Troubleshoot</summary>
  <aside class="settings-panel" aria-label="Troubleshoot">
    <p>
      Client journal keeps the last 300 simulation ticks (10 seconds), including rollbacks, within a
      2 MiB limit. It freezes when the match stops.
    </p>
    <p id="journal-status" role="status">
      No network session recorded yet.
    </p>
    <button id="download-client-journal" type="button" disabled>
      Download client journal
    </button>
    <p>Starting another network session replaces this journal. Download it before reconnecting.</p>
    <p>No disc resources or access credentials are included.</p>
  </aside>
</details>
